%% model: gemini_3_8_flash
%% prompt: 3. Collecting a parcel from a locker (prompts.md)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Courier
    participant Locker Controller
    participant Delivery Platform
    participant Notification Service
    actor Recipient

    Courier->>Locker Controller: Request compartment allocation
    Locker Controller->>Delivery Platform: Check parcel details and find free compartment
    Delivery Platform-->>Locker Controller: Assign compartment ID
    Locker Controller-->>Courier: Open assigned compartment door
    Courier->>Locker Controller: Deposit parcel and close door
    Locker Controller->>Locker Controller: Lock door and verify sensor closure
    Locker Controller->>Delivery Platform: Report delivery complete

    Delivery Platform->>Notification Service: Trigger pickup notification
    note over Notification Service,Recipient: Notifications are processed asynchronously
    Notification Service-->>Recipient: Send pickup code via SMS/Email

    loop Up to 3 attempts
        Recipient->>Locker Controller: Enter pickup code
        Locker Controller->>Delivery Platform: Validate pickup code
        alt Invalid Code
            Delivery Platform-->>Locker Controller: Code invalid
            Locker Controller-->>Recipient: Show error and remaining attempts
        else Valid Code
            Delivery Platform-->>Locker Controller: Code validated
        end
    end

    Locker Controller->>Locker Controller: Unlock and open compartment door
    Recipient->>Locker Controller: Retrieve parcel and close door
    Locker Controller->>Locker Controller: Detect empty compartment and lock door
    Locker Controller->>Delivery Platform: Confirm parcel collection
    Delivery Platform->>Delivery Platform: Mark compartment as available
    Locker Controller-->>Recipient: Display collection confirmation
